// to a similar problem`,label:"Pattern-match from memory"}],correct:0,explanation:"The brute force is not a detour — it proves you understand the problem, banks a working answer, and its bottleneck POINTS at the optimisation. The other approaches all risk ending the interview with nothing on the board.",hint:"Which strategy still produces something valuable if you never find the clever trick?"},{type:"refactor",prompt:"Max subarray sum — which of these actually works?",originalCode:`let best = -Infinity;
